-- SECTION 5: SCALE-FREE ONION-LAYERED BUFFERLESS TIR OBLIVIOUS ROUTING (TOR-IN-INET)
-- ============================================================================
-- Wraps any photonic/interaction-net flit payload in an arbitrary number n : Nat of reversible
